Package: catmech
Title: Auditable Model-Based Imputation and Category Sensitivity
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Patrick", "Iben", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "295464172+patrickiben@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Auditable completion of a continuous measurement using Gaussian
    models, predictive mean matching, or an explicitly measured internal
    reference subset. Supports flag masking, optional exact or fallible interval
    categories, posterior draws, convergence and donor-support diagnostics,
    finite-scenario sensitivity comparisons and 'mice' analysis adapters.
    Retains a separate retain-or-replace sensitivity engine. Does not identify
    measurement error without assumptions or reference information, estimate
    corruption probabilities, or guarantee coverage under misspecification.
